  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">National Audit Office B&#xe4;rkraftighet</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Audit Office Sustainability - NAODP Sustainability New Strategy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Resultatet M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att s&#xe4;kerst&#xe4;lla h&#xe5;llbara resultat som uppn&#xe5;tts    under den f&#xf6;rsta och andra faser av samarbetet (2004-2012), i         synnerhet att reglerande finansiell revision av statliga konton g&#xf6;rs  i full &#xf6;verensst&#xe4;mmelse med revisionshandledning och hanteras och     dokumenteras i lagkamrat, processen-baserad programvara f&#xf6;r           finansiell revision.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The outcome objective is to ensure sustainability of results achieved during the first and second phases of the cooperation (2004-2012), in particular that regulatory financial audits of state accounts are     done in full compliance with the audit manual and managed and         documented in TeamMate, the process-based software for financial      auditing.</narrative>
  </description>
